					by
					<a href="/members/Ryan.aspx">Ryan</a> 
					
                            
                            | with <a href="/blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/12/20/asp-net-mvc-checkbox-boolean-value-mapping.aspx#comments">no comments</a>
                        
                    
                    
